# pipe_dream .gitignore
# See AGENTS.md at the repo root for what each entry is and exactly how
# to regenerate it (all reproducible except the two explicit exceptions
# noted below).

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Generated data dumps. Every parquet/tar.gz/zip in this repo is a
# reproducible data export or archive, not source -- see AGENTS.md. ---
*.parquet
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# --- Bulk raw/cached data directories (per-ticker CSVs, SEC fundamentals,
# options exports) -- all reproducible via the scripts in final/scripts/,
# see AGENTS.md's reproduction table. ---
final/data/options_raw/
final/scripts/td_data_local/
final/scripts/td_data_delisted/
final/scripts/fundamentals_raw/
final/scripts/fundamentals_raw_delisted/

# --- Live/versioned external database clone (DoltHub
# `post-no-preference/options`) -- reproduce with `dolt clone`, see
# AGENTS.md. Do not try to store this in git; it's already its own
# version-controlled database. ---
options_raw/.dolt/

# --- Trained-model checkpoints that get overwritten on every pipeline run
# (current_signal.py / lstm_current_signal.py retrain point-in-time every
# invocation). NOTE: this is intentionally NOT the same as
# final/models/*.pkl, which is left tracked -- see AGENTS.md's "Known
# gaps" section for why (no reproduction script currently exists for
# those two files specifically). ---
final/out/models/

# --- App runtime logs (regenerates itself) ---
final/app/logs/

# --- Round 11 (2026-09-09) Sharadar point-in-time dataset. All of it is
# reproducible from final/src/ -- see claude/DATA-PIPELINE-HANDOFF.md in the
# Claude Project for the exact 9-step sequence and runtimes. Sizes are why
# these are ignored rather than tracked:
#   final/data/sharadar/panel/          1.7 GB  (30M+32.5M rows, monthly parquet)
#   final/scripts/td_data_sharadar/     525 MB  (4,011 per-ticker OHLCV CSVs)
#   final/out/features_*sharadar*.parquet 2.2 GB (already caught by *.parquet)
# The small master/derived CSVs under final/data/sharadar/ are ignored too;
# tickers_master.csv and sf1_shares.csv are one API call each to regenerate.
final/data/sharadar/
final/scripts/td_data_sharadar/

# --- Scratch/probe artifacts from the Round 11 data audit ---
final/out/_smoke_pit.log
final/out/_ckpt_*.json
final/src/_patch_*.py

# --- Repaired delisted-price CSV variants (regenerate with
# repair_ohlc_causal.py). Superseded by final/scripts/td_data_sharadar/
# as of Round 11, kept on disk only for reproducing pre-Round-11 results. ---
final/scripts/td_data_delisted_repaired/
final/scripts/td_data_delisted_repaired_causal/

# --- 2026-09-22 Alpha Vantage options pull + unified chain + Sharadar 1998 backfill.
# Reproduce: final/scripts/av_options_run_pull.sh, final/src/build_option_chain_unified.py,
# final/scripts/sharadar_backfill_1998.sh (see final/models/2026-09-22-alpha-vantage-spin.md).
final/data/alphavantage/
final/data/options_unified/
final/data/sharadar_backfill/

# WO-6 down-cap grid v2 price CSVs (5,255 files, generated).
# Reproduce: final/src/reset2026/build_downcap_grid_v2.py (see final/models/2026-09-24-downcap-grid-rebuild.md).
final/scripts/td_data_sharadar_downcap_v2/
